##########################
# OBJ (West EU)
##########################
# Map scripts here are modified for 6x6 maps, to avoid having an objective, 
# such as the bomb in bomb defusal, spawn next to the start location.
#
# The way the added commands work, they need to go first, otherwise you end
# up with a large amount of technicals, or bombs.

  #CMP#
